LFM2 Kilix Commands is a modified LiquidAI/LFM2-1.2B-Tool model.
Base revision: 6d24c6b7471fcbcec084935e377a5302f4b84389.
Modified by itsmygithubacct: supervised LoRA fine tuning on synthetic command
examples, merging in bfloat16, conversion to GGUF and Q8_0 quantization,
followed by direct weight edits for the Kilix command interface.

The weight-edit lineage includes an explicit output projection initialized
from the parent embedding matrix and constrained edits to its empty-call
token row. This revision changes only output.weight row 8104 relative to
its immediate parent; the input embeddings and all other bytes are unchanged
relative to that parent. This is a modified model, not an upstream release.
No additional gradient training was used for this revision.

